* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ucann (reference/crafted.toml, 15 Nov 2026): user constraints on
* the annual, undiscounted investment costs, taxes and subsidies of new capacity (UC_ATTR
* INVCOST, INVTAX, INVSUB on an NCAP term; uc_ncap.mod L39 with CST_ANNC of eqbndcst.mod
* L49-77; M1.3 change 42, docs/m13-plan.md). Added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo
* @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). ppmain.mod L1156 adds the attribute ANNUL to each of these, and L1161
* the attribute CUMSUM, so each constraint is dynamic in the RHS direction (equserco.mod
* L80-106): in each period the term sums the capacity installed up to that period, each vintage
* with its annual cost in that period's milestone year.
* demo12 has no investment taxes or subsidies, so the case adds them first:
* - NCAP_ITAX on ELCTNCOA01 and ELCNNNUC01 (REG1) and ELCTNGAS01 (REG2);
* - NCAP_ISUB on ELCRNWIN01 (both regions).
* The constraints:
* - ANN_INV (EQ_UCR, REG1 and REG2 each): the annual investment cost of new coal, nuclear,
*   wind, gas and (REG1) biomass plants (INVCOST) is at most a bound in each period.
* - ANN_TXS (EQ_UC, REG1 and REG2 summed): the annual investment taxes less the subsidies
*   (INVTAX, INVSUB) together with the investment cost of the period (COST, OBJ_ICOST) of the
*   same plants, at most a bound in each period.
* - ANN_RHS (EQ_UCR, REG1): the annual investment cost of new gas plants at most twice that
*   of new biomass plants plus a constant (INVCOST on both sides).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
NCAP_ITAX ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01.MEuro05 200
REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01.MEuro05 100
REG2.2006.ELCTNGAS01.MEuro05 50
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_ISUB ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCRNWIN01.MEuro05 300
REG2.2005.ELCRNWIN01.MEuro05 200
/

SET UC_N
/
ANN_INV 'Annual investment cost of new plants'
ANN_TXS 'Annual investment taxes less subsidies of new plants'
ANN_RHS 'Annual investment cost of new nuclear against new wind'
/

SET UC_R_EACH
/
REG1.ANN_INV
REG2.ANN_INV
REG1.ANN_RHS
/

SET UC_R_SUM
/
REG1.ANN_TXS
REG2.ANN_TXS
/

SET UC_ATTR
/
REG1.ANN_INV.LHS.NCAP.INVCOST
REG2.ANN_INV.LHS.NCAP.INVCOST
REG1.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.INVTAX
REG1.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.INVSUB
REG1.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.COST
REG2.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.INVTAX
REG2.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.INVSUB
REG2.ANN_TXS.LHS.NCAP.COST
REG1.ANN_RHS.LHS.NCAP.INVCOST
REG1.ANN_RHS.RHS.NCAP.INVCOST
/

PARAMETER
UC_NCAP ' '/
ANN_INV.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCRNWIN01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG1.2006.ELCTNGAS01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCRNBIO01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCTNCOA01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCRNWIN01 1
ANN_INV.LHS.REG2.2006.ELCTNGAS01 1
ANN_TXS.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTNCOA01 1
ANN_TXS.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCNNNUC01 1
ANN_TXS.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCRNWIN01 1
ANN_TXS.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCRNWIN01 1
ANN_TXS.LHS.REG2.2006.ELCTNGAS01 1
ANN_RHS.LHS.REG1.2006.ELCTNGAS01 1
ANN_RHS.RHS.REG1.2005.ELCRNBIO01 2
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSRT ' '/
REG1.ANN_INV.2005.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_INV.2010.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_INV.2015.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_INV.2020.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_INV.2030.UP 12000
REG1.ANN_INV.2050.UP 100000
REG2.ANN_INV.2005.UP 100000
REG2.ANN_INV.2010.UP 100000
REG2.ANN_INV.2015.UP 100000
REG2.ANN_INV.2020.UP 100000
REG2.ANN_INV.2030.UP 9000
REG2.ANN_INV.2050.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_RHS.2005.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_RHS.2010.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_RHS.2015.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_RHS.2020.UP 2500
REG1.ANN_RHS.2030.UP 100000
REG1.ANN_RHS.2050.UP 100000
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHST ' '/
ANN_TXS.2005.UP 100000
ANN_TXS.2010.UP 100000
ANN_TXS.2015.UP 100000
ANN_TXS.2020.UP 100000
ANN_TXS.2030.UP 100000
ANN_TXS.2050.UP 100000
/
